le=\"color:#000\"> mixture</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;P&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">40</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dynamics</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;trend&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">default</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lamformula</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> siteCovs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> na</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">action </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  the length of the variables differs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">found </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;oc1$year_fac&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div>Note that this last line of code, when using oc1$year_fac sometimes creates a fatal error and makes R crash completely.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Also, please excuse me if the error messages are not exactly phrased as you are used to, I had to translate them from my own language.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks a lot,</div><div>Clémence</div><div><br></div></div>"
